      # SRI/milepost -> lat/lon lookup, read via `nj_crashes.sri.mp05.get_mp05_map()`
      # during geocoding. It is a network-fetched accumulator (`fetch_sri_mps` hits the
      # NJDOT ArcGIS service per SRI and appends), not derivable from tracked inputs —
      # and it was caught by the global `*.db` excludesfile, so it never showed as
      # untracked. Reproc round 3 died here with `ValueError: Table sri_mp not found`.
      /nj_sri_mp.db: 6c1e4917dcbd23e5ad48d277ae622dc1
      # `njdot/crashes.py` reads `crash_dupes/merged.pqt` when building 2023. Declaring
      # the producer stage was not enough — without this edge both sat in the same level
      # and raced (round 5: crash_dupes completed in 14.9s, but crashes.parquet had
      # already read the missing file).
